OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of heavy and thundery
OL,6,Frain will soon clear eastwards. The
OL,7,Frest of the day will be mainly dry
OL,8,Fwith bright spells and scattered
OL,9,Fshowers. Best of the warm sunshine
OL,10,Facross Angus and Fife.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FBright spells and scattered
OL,13,Fshowers in the evening. Mostly dry
OL,14,Fovernight with clear spells but the
OL,15,Fodd shower will affect the west.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA lot of dry and bright
OL,18,Fweather. A few scattered showers in
OL,19,Fthe west at first, these spreading
OL,20,Feast in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
