OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and scattered showers on
OL,7,FSunday. Mostly dry on Monday then rain
OL,8,Fspreading east.later. Showers or
OL,9,Flonger spells of rain on Tuesday.
